               <t:floruit notBefore="0200" notAfter="0350">It is unclear whether he was a real or fictional person. He likely lived sometime between the 3rd century and the beginning of the 4th century. 
                  He appears in <t:title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1455GadlaG">Gadla Giyorgis (Lydda)</t:title> as the king who persecuted <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS4585Georgeo">Saint George</t:persName> and subjected him to many tortures.</t:floruit>
